     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I didn't see fcrepo4-upgrade-utils and fcrepo-karaf as components. Should we create separate issues for those? Or, just add those components, and then add those components to this ticket?",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Also, I can close ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
